From: krita.js contributors
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: exclude Emscripten from desktop X11 discovery

Emscripten passes the existing non-Windows/non-Apple/non-Android guard,
but has no X11 or desktop DBus integration. Use the existing non-desktop
branch so HAVE_X11 and HAVE_DBUS remain false for the browser build.

Applies to: Krita v6.0.4.1 (bd6e8d061d2f0388c5b10278786cf0fe62e3135f)
Validation: patch application and unchanged native branch; full Wasm configure pending dependencies
Upstream status: local porting patch, not submitted

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -902,7 +902,7 @@ if (Qt${QT_MAJOR_VERSION}QuickWidgets_FOUND)
 endif()
 
 
-if (NOT WIN32 AND NOT APPLE AND NOT ANDROID AND NOT HAIKU)
+if (NOT WIN32 AND NOT APPLE AND NOT ANDROID AND NOT HAIKU AND NOT EMSCRIPTEN)
     if (QT_MAJOR_VERSION STREQUAL "5")
         find_package(Qt${QT_MAJOR_VERSION} ${MIN_QT_VERSION} REQUIRED X11Extras)
     endif()
